# Tessera stdlib: the correctly rounded 2^x of BF16
#
# x = x1 + x2, where x1 keeps the sign, the exponent and the upper 4 bits of the mantissa and x2 the exponent and the
# lower 3 bits: 2^x = 2^x1 2^x2, both tabulated as B32 values whose product rounds correctly to BF16. Round to
# nearest only: overflow gives +inf, underflow +0 or the exact subnormal power of 2, NaN comes back quiet.
#
# Ported from CORE-MATH, src/binaryb16/exp2/exp2_bf16.c.
# Copyright (c) 2025 Paul Zimmermann
# MIT license: see LICENSE-CORE-MATH

module System/Numerics/BF16

